Bucky is no stranger to ghosts of his past, not in the slightest.
However, he didn’t think James Howlett would be one of them.
// A tiny little conversation between Logan and Bucky.

Emma Frost knows a few things;
- She hates snow- She hates cheery people- She hates being cold- She hates being snowed in- She hates Christmas- She hates Christmas
Just her luck that she is forced to deal with all of those as her flight back to Boston is cancelled during a snowstorm. Now, she is forced to lie low with a cheery redhead with two way too adorable children.

